 will continue to be updated as frequently as before, so don't worry, your game progress will be preserved in the original version of Scream Jam. \n\nWhat Scream Jam is right now is solely for testing the characters. In the future, it will have mechanics that will set it apart.\n\n The game is in a very early alpha stage, so it's very unstable. \nExpect to find errors and bugs, in addition to very questionable balance. \n\n--NOTHING YOU SEE IN THE GAME IS THE FINAL PRODUCT-- \n\nThis game isn't trying to look retro (trust me). Another asymmetrical horror game trying to achieve something more.\n\nUsing exploits will result in a permanent ban (I don't know who would do that, honestly). \n\nPrimarily inspired by Die of Death (you should try that too!).","path":"/game/94601738353649-scream-jam","slug":"94601738353649-scream-jam","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3f06768c4923d6212eba4d194c043e454a50e5f51bcb59cd57f3ed565541fa17.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-dd0626a769991a7fb4116b8f635e48f8/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":5409559,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-02-08T20:11:35.218Z","creator":{"name":"Te Amamos Remi","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":91036151820575,"name":"Be a Nurse","desc":"🩺 Welcome to Be a Nurse! 🏥\nReady to heal the world? Start your nursing journey today!\nNew updates every week!\n\n🧑‍⚕️Begin your career as an Orientee and work your way up the ranks!\n🤲Complete patient care tasks and unlock new hospital units.\n🏥Tackle real-world scenarios in ER, ICU, PACU, and more!\n\n🔓 Use Code: NEW, 100_LIKeS, 1k_likes, 5k_LiKES, 12k_likES, K_25LIKES, 50_Likes_k\nNext code unlocks at 120k Likes!\n❤️ Support us by liking, favoriting, and joining our group for exclusive codes and updates!\n\nTags: CNA, Nurse, Doctor, ER, ICU, Hospital, Simulation, Roleplay, Patient Care, Nursing Simulator, Tycoon, Be a CNA, CNA simulator, Be a Nurse\n\nDisclaimer: This game is a f